.TH DANBY-PENDULUMPERIOD 1
.SH NAME
danby-pendulumperiod \- amplitude dependence of pendulum period
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/pendulumperiod
.SH MODEL
The exact sine equation is compared with the small-angle prediction
2 pi sqrt(L/g). Increasing amplitude makes the actual oscillation visibly
depart from the approximation.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/pendulumperiod.b
